:1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.95,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"urolithiasis","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":2.9,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"wounds","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":2,"lift":3.61,"evidence_tier":"sparse"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:262-rupture-wort":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Rupture-Wort","headword":"Rupture-Wort","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"They say Saturn causes ruptures; if he do, he does no more than he can cure; if you want wit, he will teach you, though to your cost. This herb is Saturn’s own, and is a noble antivenerean. Rupture-wort hath not its name in vain: for it is found by experience to cure the rupture, not only in children but also in elder persons, if the disease be not too inveterate, by taking a dram of the powder of the dried herb every day in wine, or a decoction made and drank for certain days together. The juice or distilled water of the green herb, taken in the same manner, helps all other fluxes either of man or woman; vomitings also, and the gonorrhea, being taken any of the ways aforesaid. It doth also most assuredly help those that have the stranguary, or are troubled with the stone or gravel in the reins or bladder. The same also helps stitches in the sides, griping pains of the stomach or belly, the obstructions of the liver, and cures the yellow jaundice; likewise it kills also the worms in children. Being outwardly applied, it conglutinates wounds notably, and helps much to stay defluctions of rheum from the head to the eyes, nose, and teeth, being bruised green and bound thereto; or the forehead, temples, or the nape of the neck behind, bathed with the decoction of the dried herb. It also dries up the moisture of fistulous ulcers, or any other that are foul and spreading.","spans":[{"start":176,"end":188,"concept_id":"syphilis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":613,"end":622,"concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":740,"end":750,"concept_id":"dysuria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":777,"end":782,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":786,"end":792,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":800,"end":805,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":809,"end":816,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":838,"end":846,"concept_id":"pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":861,"end":868,"concept_id":"colic","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":869,"end":889,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":904,"end":929,"concept_id":"liver_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":952,"end":960,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":989,"end":994,"concept_id":"helminthiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1050,"end":1056,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1089,"end":1135,"concept_id":"conjunctivitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1329,"end":1338,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1339,"end":1345,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"cul:262-rupture-wort":{"176":"antivenereal: remedy against the pox","613":"stays vomiting / vomits","740":"strangury (stranguary): slow, painful urination","777":"the stone (urinary calculus)","786":"gravel: small urinary concretions","800":"reins: kidneys","809":"bladder","838":"stitch: sharp pain in the side","861":"gripings: colicky abdominal pains","869":"pains / gnawing / heat of the stomach","904":"obstructions / heat of the liver","952":"yellow jaundice, black jaundice","989":"worms (intestinal)","1050":"wounds (green, fresh, inward, old); wound-herb","1089":"defluxion of rheum into the eyes","1329":"fistula, fistulous ulcers","1339":"ulcers (old, foul, running, fretting)"}},"images":[]}